<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Micron EPS view raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Micron EPS view raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch said it raised its 1997 earnings expectations for Micron Technology Inc to $1.55 a share from $1.50 a share and increased the 1998 earnings forecast to $4.05 a share from $3.50 a share.</p>
<p>-- said the 18-month price target is $55 a share.</p>
<p>-- said reiterates near-term accumulate rating and long-term buy rating.</p>
</text>
